    <briefdescription>
<para>Module to work with arrays of bits (bitsets) </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Bitset is an array of bits where each bit can be set or unset independently. The bits of a <ref refid="" kindref="compound">bitset</ref> are indexed by <emphasis>size_t</emphasis> position number. Initially all bits are set to false. You can use any values in range [0,SIZE_MAX). The container grows automatically. </para>    </detaileddescription>
